@a = http://localhost:5103
@b = http://localhost:5104

### Identificar A
GET {{a}}/instance

### Identificar B
GET {{b}}/instance

### 1. Primeira execucao em A: 201, replay false
POST {{a}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: purchase-multi

{"productId":123,"quantity":2}

### 2. Repetir em A: replay true
POST {{a}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: purchase-multi

{"productId":123,"quantity":2}

### 3. Mesma chave e corpo em B: replay false, outra execucao
POST {{b}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: purchase-multi

{"productId":123,"quantity":2}

### 4. Repetir em B: replay true
POST {{b}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: purchase-multi

{"productId":123,"quantity":2}

### Pedidos locais de A
GET {{a}}/orders

### Pedidos locais de B
GET {{b}}/orders

### Apos reiniciar apenas A, repetir bloco 1: replay false e novo X-Instance-Run-Id.
### Repetir bloco 4 em B: replay true e mesmo X-Instance-Run-Id, antes da expiracao.
